WEBVTT

00:01:32.330 --> 00:01:33.870
Huh? Where's Takuma?

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:38.830
Takuma is off taking the national mock exam.

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:43.290
That thing he was up til late
last night studying for, right?

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:47.080
Oh, then we should have sukiyaki
in celebration of today.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:50.330
Big Sister Misa, you just want to
eat sukiyaki, don't you?

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:52.750
I'm home.

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.290
Welcome back, Big Brother Takuma!

00:01:55.700 --> 00:01:56.750
Takuma?!

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:00.330
Oh my, what's wrong?

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:04.200
The testing site was more crowded than I anticipated...

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:08.580
I was so terrified by the situation
the entire test was a complete disaster.

00:02:08.580 --> 00:02:10.540
You were so terrified you shrunk?!

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:15.000
Okay, let's play a game of Tag!

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:20.330
Huh? You want to play Tag?

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:22.080
Sounds like fun!

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:24.450
Let's play, Big Brother Takuma!

00:02:24.950 --> 00:02:27.870
I can't, I have to study...

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:29.830
Big Brother Takuma, you pervert!

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.120
What?!

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:33.870
All you do is study and you never play with me!

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:35.290
I-I'm sorry!

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:39.200
I've just been so out of shape lately, it's ridiculous.

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:41.200
Please, just this once.

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:46.200
If I tell them no right now,
they'd probably disrupt my studies...

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:47.660
Okay, just once.

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:51.950
Okay then, let's all draw and
whoever gets the red one is It.

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:56.200
Guess I'm It!

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.080
Futaba is It...

00:02:58.080 --> 00:02:59.410
I'm awake now.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.540
You're joking.

00:03:00.540 --> 00:03:02.620
Then the competition has to be...

00:03:02.950 --> 00:03:05.330
You lose when your panties are stolen, okay?

00:03:05.330 --> 00:03:07.500
You lose if you get your panties stolen?!

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:10.040
Alright then, ready...

00:03:10.410 --> 00:03:11.500
Start!

00:03:12.950 --> 00:03:15.830
I'm going to give chase after 3 minutes!

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:20.370
I don't have the time to do things like this...

00:03:20.370 --> 00:03:22.700
Maybe I can hide somewhere and study...

00:03:26.370 --> 00:03:28.370
I-I-I-I-I'm sorry!

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:29.790
Takuma-san...

00:03:30.160 --> 00:03:32.120
I can't stop staring!

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:34.910
We sisters are indeed freeloaders.

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:38.790
However, we should at least receive
the bare minimum of manners.

00:03:39.370 --> 00:03:42.750
I would appreciate it if you would knock next time.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.000
O-okay.

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:46.830
Sorry about that, Takumacchi.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:48.750
That was a strange thing to see.

00:03:48.750 --> 00:03:51.000
I just wanted some of this thread...

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:52.120
Thread?

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:57.160
I was going to use my sacred sword
to sense Futaba's movement.

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:01.790
I was unraveling a string from this shirt
and stretching it all through the house.

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:04.410
Wh-why are you doing all of that?

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.120
Because she's reached full proficiency
in the Gourai Isshin-style

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:09.370
as the top disciple of Thor, the god of thunder.

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:14.830
Even at level 1, Futaba is strong enough
to snatch a pair of panties in an instant!

00:04:14.830 --> 00:04:16.200
Again with the panties?!

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:19.040
Also, the nickname she got from that strength is...

00:04:19.620 --> 00:04:21.000
"Her Majesty the Queen!"

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.700
A panty-snatching queen?!

00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:28.540
Well, I'm going to focus on the string,
so you two get prepared to attack.

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:33.450
What is this air of intimidation?

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:36.790
I guess choosing to pat her on the head
in the gym storage room

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:38.870
was the wrong thing to do after all...

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:41.120
I-I'm sorr-

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:43.450
I've been doing my best recently!

00:04:43.450 --> 00:04:44.500
What?

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.120
Not only have I been doing
various student council duties,

00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:50.660
but I'm also checking over the events for
campus festival attendees and everything...

00:04:50.660 --> 00:04:53.160
I've done my very best, lately!

00:04:53.370 --> 00:04:55.410
So... um...

00:04:55.910 --> 00:04:59.500
It's alright to pat me as a reward.

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.250
Is it okay to pat you on the head?

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:06.080
If that's what you want to do,
Takuma-san, then by all means!

00:05:06.620 --> 00:05:09.700
It seems like she'll be mad if I don't.

00:05:13.330 --> 00:05:14.500
Itsuyo-san?!

00:05:15.120 --> 00:05:17.410
D-don't worry...about it.

00:05:19.620 --> 00:05:23.250
Please continue... to do that pat-pat.

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:25.250
"Do that pat-pat?"

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:29.790
N-no, I mean...

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:34.290
Get away from the wall!

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:46.080
Y-you don't need to pat me there yet...

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:48.700
I-I-I-I'm sorry!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.410
Relax, Takuma-chan.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:56.370
I'll fix your damaged house later
with my sacred sword.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.330
Big Sister Misa, it's...

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:01.160
Futaba has her glasses on!

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:02.870
G-glasses?!

00:06:03.120 --> 00:06:07.370
Futaba's eyesight is so bad,
she can't see anything with her naked eye.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:10.700
So when she's serious about fighting,
she puts on her glasses!

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.450
And then she steals her defeated opponents' panties!

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:15.660
But why panties?!

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:17.830
Panties are the last line of defense.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:18.830
Gulp!

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:22.290
Hence, having one's panties stolen,

00:06:22.290 --> 00:06:25.450
is, in other words, equivalent to death.

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:27.080
Death

00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:26.500
Death?!

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:28.620
Huh?

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.160
Takumacchi, take flight!

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:39.580
Oh dear, Takuma-chan got away
and now you're the bait.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:43.330
Bait? Underestimating us would be a mistake, Futaba.

00:06:43.580 --> 00:06:45.330
It's two on one, now!

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:47.450
Don't assume you can take us down so easily!

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:49.950
Oh my...

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:53.200
I'm not assuming I can take you down easily at all.

00:06:53.450 --> 00:06:57.790
Let's see, to borrow the words of Big Sister Ichika,

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:02.370
if it's for my beloved sisters,
I will take all the time I need.

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:06.370
Now then, please hand over your panties.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:11.410
Ouch. That was very violent.

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:15.620
Squishy?!

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:21.040
Big Brother, I'd like you to
give me back my headphones.

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.700
Huh? Oh, sure...

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:29.370
Suddenly flying in without warning
and forcing a younger girl down,

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:32.830
and furthermore, thoroughly groping her chest...

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:34.870
I hope you die.

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:41.080
Ooh, there they are!

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:43.700
Hey, why is he so pale?

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:44.950
Dunno.

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:48.660
Anyway, we have to work out a strategy.

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:52.620
The discrepancy between Futaba's combat ability
and ours is glaringly obvious.

00:07:52.870 --> 00:07:56.830
The most dangerous part of it is
her holy sword "Castle" ability.

00:07:57.290 --> 00:08:02.290
The holy sword "Castle" is the ability to summon
the entirety of Asgard's Valhalla.

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:06.660
At level 1 she can only summon one castle wall,

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:09.080
but until she employs that strategy,

00:08:09.080 --> 00:08:11.540
Her Majesty the Queen won't stop.

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:15.290
However, as long as we can
manage to outrun her, then we win.

00:08:15.580 --> 00:08:18.040
Only think about protecting yourself.

00:08:21.200 --> 00:08:23.700
I spy panties...

00:08:23.830 --> 00:08:26.040
H-Her Majesty the Queen!

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.250
We're doing exactly what we discussed!

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:30.700
Level 1, sacred sword summon!!

00:08:32.700 --> 00:08:34.660
Sacred sword, strengthened.

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:38.910
So you're using a co-op technique, huh?

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.580
However...

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:44.910
I wonder if you can break through
my "castle" with that?

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:52.330
I absolutely cannot go along with them.

00:08:52.580 --> 00:08:54.830
I'll hide in the storehouse for now.

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:57.410
Are you sure about that?

00:08:58.450 --> 00:09:00.410
There's a voice coming from the storehouse!

00:09:00.830 --> 00:09:03.500
My father once told me a proverb.

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:09.040
"If a coward escapes from battle,
he thinks he can live forever.

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:14.910
However, even if he can avoid the lance,
he cannot avoid the advancement of age."

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:18.950
You can understand that too, right, Master?

00:09:19.790 --> 00:09:25.750
What should you fight for, to reach your own goals?

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.830
W-well...

00:09:31.250 --> 00:09:33.750
You can't do that, Natsuki-chan.

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:37.160
No panty-less persons on the battlefield.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:38.750
Panty-less?!

00:09:38.750 --> 00:09:39.540
Ow!

00:09:39.790 --> 00:09:42.500
Well now, next is Takuma-chan.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:49.200
Only three more meters to Takuma-chan's undies...

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:50.080
Death!

00:09:52.250 --> 00:09:54.080
Academic
Achievement

00:09:55.040 --> 00:09:58.080
Here's a good luck charm
for your academic achievement.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:02.450
A rune that stands for knowledge, is the best thing
to keep your needs etched into your mind.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:03.370
Huh?

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:06.370
That one is handmade by us.

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:10.370
Jeez, Futaba, you got a bit too serious with this one.

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:14.000
I do apologize. I got so excited!

00:10:14.120 --> 00:10:18.700
Actually, this game of Tag was a plan
to help refresh you, Takuma-chan.

00:10:19.000 --> 00:10:22.950
Takuma-chan, you're always staying up
studying until late, right?

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:25.200
I was hoping it'd be a good outlet for you.

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:28.540
Natsuki-chan, I'm sorry.

00:10:28.540 --> 00:10:30.790
I was the one who gave him the present...

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:34.370
I-I-I don't care who gave it to him!

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:40.540
Anyway, that's a present from us to thank you
for always taking care of us.

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:45.620
I-I mean, it's nothing big,
but you've accepted us into your home, and...

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:48.410
Is Takuma dead?!

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:52.330
I told you that if this game of Tag was too stressful,
something like that could happen.

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.580
Big Brother Takuma, you're super pale!

00:10:54.580 --> 00:10:56.160
I hope he does die.

00:10:56.160 --> 00:10:59.790
Whoa, Yakumo, he might actually be dead, you know!

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:01.290
Oh dear.

00:11:05.290 --> 00:11:08.950
I see. You got the good luck charm
to Takuma-kun safely.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:10.580
You really call that safe?

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:12.620
Everything after it was a mess.

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:17.750
And also, I played with Big Brother Takuma,
and it was fun!

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:20.040
That's great, Kururi-chan!

00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:23.080
Big Bro forced me down, though...

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:26.250
T..Takuma-kun forced you down?!

00:11:26.250 --> 00:11:27.080
Yup.

00:11:27.080 --> 00:11:28.540
What?!

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:31.410
We worked hard together to make it.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:35.620
I hope he's happy with... with that good luck charm.

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:41.370
Mom...

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:45.250
It turns out I really can't live with other people.

00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:49.290
Why do I have to go through this?

00:11:50.370 --> 00:11:54.000
But I wonder how long it's been...

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:59.910
Academic
Achievement

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:58.160
since I've gotten a present from someone?

00:12:00.580 --> 00:12:02.830
It's almost time for the campus festival.

00:12:03.330 --> 00:12:06.830
Along with the Val Love for
"Campus Festival Date" is "live together,"

00:12:06.830 --> 00:12:09.580
so this is a chance to everyone to raise their levels!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.080
We must make this a success, by all means!

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:16.250
The problem is all of the instances of
Father's oracles being wrong.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:19.620
Did you all see anything suspicious out there?

00:12:19.620 --> 00:12:23.250
It's not necessarily the case that their souls
are accidentally drawn into these things.

00:12:24.580 --> 00:12:26.250
Their souls are accidentally...

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:27.870
What about you, Itsuyo?

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:31.540
Let me see. Suspicious people...

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:32.500
Lovely
Council
Stu
dent

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:34.000
Lovely to see you!

00:12:32.500 --> 00:12:33.450
to see you!
Council
Stu
dent

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:38.250
Council
Stu
dent

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:36.580
All of them are good people.

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:37.870
I see.

00:12:38.370 --> 00:12:41.830
Sorry, no one suspicious comes to mind.

00:12:41.830 --> 00:12:44.830
I mean, the most suspicious person around is me, so...

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:46.870
No one stands out to me either.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:48.290
Big Sister Misa...

00:12:48.290 --> 00:12:49.370
Huh?

00:12:49.370 --> 00:12:52.540
What's up with you two?
I thought you were sleeping.

00:12:52.540 --> 00:12:54.620
Kururi was crying.

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:57.830
Oof.

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:59.910
Did you have a bad dream?

00:13:00.250 --> 00:13:02.910
I'm right here with you, so calm down, okay?

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:08.080
I'll verify the oracle being wrong with Valhalla.

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:12.700
In any case, our combat power is still unstable here.

00:13:12.700 --> 00:13:15.700
Everyone be careful, and let's support this date!

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:17.410
For the campus festival...

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:21.700
it looks like our class will be doing a maid café.

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:24.160
I-I gotta potty.

00:13:24.160 --> 00:13:25.500
Do you know what that is?

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:33.250
Pa... Father told me that a maid outfit may be
the same as a woman's combat uniform in this world!

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:35.370
I wonder what they look like.

00:13:36.160 --> 00:13:38.700
You're enjoying this, aren't you, Natsuki-san?

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:42.950
Campus festivals aren't part of the culture of Asgard.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:46.870
Even though it's my duty,
I'm looking forward to going around all the shops!

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:53.330
Well, I guess you aren't interested in going
on a date at the campus festival, though.

00:13:53.330 --> 00:13:59.540
No, I'm looking forward to the festival, too.

00:13:59.540 --> 00:14:00.540
Huh?

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:02.120
Because...

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:07.410
I have free time during the festival,
so I can study all I want!

00:14:07.410 --> 00:14:08.750
Oh, right...

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.950
Natsuki, what do you think you're doing
during break time?

00:14:14.950 --> 00:14:17.040
I'm cleaning, of course.

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:20.620
I have to make sure the school building is nice and tidy!

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:22.450
After all, today I am...

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:27.040
For just one day
Class
Commander

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:24.500
on day duty!

00:14:24.500 --> 00:14:26.790
At least this much can be done before breakfast!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:32.660
Is Takuma studying?

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:35.160
He's always like that, no matter what time it is.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:38.160
Yesterday, he wouldn't even look in my direction.

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:42.080
N..Natsuki-chan!

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:44.200
Cleaning on your own sure is rough, huh?

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:45.910
I'll help you out.

00:14:47.040 --> 00:14:48.750
Natsuki-chan, are you listening?

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.750
Goodness, what do I do about this?

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:53.660
Natsuki-chan, can you hear me?

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:55.120
Could it be...

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:58.410
that he's not attracted to me?!

00:14:58.700 --> 00:15:01.950
Compared to Itsuyo and the others,
my body is definitely lacking...

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:07.870
But I'm still developing, and thinking back on it,
I think I've been the harshest on Takuma so far...

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:10.080
Natsuki-chan?

00:15:10.080 --> 00:15:14.250
Maybe I should play up my cute side some more...

00:15:14.700 --> 00:15:16.450
Natsuki Saotome-san?

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:18.250
I-I don't, though!

00:15:18.250 --> 00:15:21.330
This is just... to level up more efficiently!

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:25.250
Y..Yamada-kun?!

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:28.200
I'm sorry! I was just... well...

00:15:28.200 --> 00:15:30.950
I-It's okay, Natsuki-chan.

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:33.250
No it isn't, really...

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.000
Sorry, okay?

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:36.830
She's an angel!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.000
Yamada-kun?!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:40.160
Yamada fell again!

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.580
Natsuki.

00:15:41.580 --> 00:15:44.290
We need a favor from you, is that okay?

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:51.370
You know there's an inspection for
what we're doing at the festival, right?

00:15:51.370 --> 00:15:54.870
We have to do a demonstration
in front of a student council member.

00:15:54.870 --> 00:15:56.790
W-well...

00:15:57.040 --> 00:16:02.410
The girl that's supposed to do it is absent today,
so we'd like you to do it in her place...

00:16:03.080 --> 00:16:04.790
Oh man, she's an angel!

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.000
So cute!

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:08.410
THIS is the rumored maid outfit?

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:10.700
It's much cuter than I imagined it would be!

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:14.290
I hate that it calls attention to my worst feature
but I have to do my best.

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:17.580
After all, I'm on day duty!

00:16:17.870 --> 00:16:19.200
Excuse me.

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:21.290
I'm Inukai from the student council.

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:24.450
I'm here to inspect your festival presentation.

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:31.790
Frozen

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:31.790

stiff

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:25.910
O-okay!

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:29.370
Thank you for your guidance todyay... today!

00:16:29.370 --> 00:16:32.620
Oh no, thank you for your cooperation.

00:16:34.790 --> 00:16:36.000
Is something wrong?

00:16:36.000 --> 00:16:40.410
Ah, no. I was just recalling something that
the president was concerned about.

00:16:40.410 --> 00:16:41.540
Itsuyo?

00:16:41.750 --> 00:16:45.500
Something like your interests being
far too childish for your age, Natsuki-senpai.

00:16:45.500 --> 00:16:46.660
What?!

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:48.120
Th-they aren't...

00:16:48.120 --> 00:16:50.370
I have work to do for my day duty...

00:16:50.370 --> 00:16:53.330
but I don't have particularly childish interests...

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:55.160
It's alright.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:58.410
It looks great on you, Natsuki-senpai.

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:01.830
Th-thank you.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:04.200
Ugh.

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:07.370
You seriously believe what I said about that dress?

00:17:07.370 --> 00:17:13.450
But why did I have to be so nice to those
who are part of the main gods in the first place?

00:17:13.450 --> 00:17:14.950
I'm going to devour you!

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:17.950
Don't you blush at me!

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:20.200
And you can't just talk to me freely!

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:22.200
You meatless skin bag.

00:17:22.200 --> 00:17:25.160
Thicken up and then do your squealing!

00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:27.950
Oh, it's nothing.

00:17:28.620 --> 00:17:31.700
Well then, shall we go ahead
and begin the inspection?

00:17:32.080 --> 00:17:34.000
It's like watching an angel and an akuma.

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:36.250
Is Natsuki-chan okay?

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:39.620
How did this happen?

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:42.450
You may begin.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:48.250
He's still uninterested in me, just like always!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:53.080
Watch me now! I'll show you that I have a cute side!

00:17:53.370 --> 00:17:55.750
Maid outfits... are a woman's...

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:57.290
combat uniform!

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:57.620
Combat uniform!!

00:17:58.040 --> 00:18:00.620
Welcome home, Master!

00:18:00.620 --> 00:18:01.580
Throb!

00:18:01.580 --> 00:18:03.540
Oh no, death by cuteness!

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:05.580
I think I might fall out of the window again...

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:07.410
An excellent response!

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:09.700
Now witness this technique
transmitted directly from Papa!

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:12.080
He's not looking!

00:18:12.080 --> 00:18:13.620
Dammit!

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:16.120
I'll make you a parfait.

00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:18.000
What kind would you like?

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:21.040
Uh... I'm not very hungry right now.

00:18:21.040 --> 00:18:24.580
Choose from vanilla, chocolate, or green tea, please!

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.580
I-I'll have vanilla.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.250
Dammit!

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:30.200
Day Duty
Natsuki
Saotome

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:31.750
Apologies for the wait!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.450
Is this the, uh... vanilla?

00:18:34.450 --> 00:18:35.410
Yeah!

00:18:35.410 --> 00:18:38.040
It's my own special interpretation!

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:39.290
Interpretation?

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:42.620
Now then, to top it off,
we'll cast some magic on it to make it yummy!

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:45.000
While I add the cream...

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:47.370
Huh? The cream won't come out...

00:18:57.450 --> 00:19:00.790
S-sorry, I'll clean you up right away.

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:02.250
Screw that Akuma!!

00:19:02.250 --> 00:19:06.370
That jerk! How dare he get so close
to Natsuki-chan's maid outfit?!

00:19:06.370 --> 00:19:08.330
I wanna eat her parfait too!

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:14.870
Come on, stay still!

00:19:14.870 --> 00:19:16.910
But I can do it myself!

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:18.080
Feed us...

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:19.080
Huh?

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.700
PARFAITS!

00:19:23.700 --> 00:19:25.910
These are... akuma!

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:28.250
What's going on?

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:31.000
There were no signs of any until a little while ago!

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:38.080
I can't believe there's a demon appearing
on campus again after the other day.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:39.910
And at a time like this...

00:19:40.620 --> 00:19:44.870
Could it be that whoever is interfering with the oracle
is an accomplice of the malevolent gods?!

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:48.000
Save me!

00:19:47.120 --> 00:19:48.000
He's so weak!

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:49.500
What a pain!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.040
Natsuki-san!

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:56.120
No, let me go!

00:19:56.870 --> 00:19:58.580
What are you doing?!

00:20:00.660 --> 00:20:01.870
Help me...

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:03.540
Takuma...

00:20:02.290 --> 00:20:03.540
Takuma...

00:20:16.750 --> 00:20:18.750
A-are you okay?

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:22.750
Thanks.

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:25.660
I get it now.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:30.660
So this is the limit of the Valkyries in their human forms.

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:38.410
Today was rough, wasn't it?

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:41.000
It sure was.

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:44.790
And today's commotion ruined the afternoon classes.

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:48.830
Seriously, studying is the only thing
you think about, huh?

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:50.450
S-sorry.

00:20:50.620 --> 00:20:53.040
It doesn't matter. I'm used to it already.

00:20:54.450 --> 00:20:56.250
Well, it's fine, I guess.

00:20:56.250 --> 00:21:00.540
You probably don't want to be with
a girl who's as homely as I am anyway.

00:21:02.250 --> 00:21:05.080
I think you're pretty cute, though.

00:21:06.080 --> 00:21:07.200
Huh?

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.250
Huh?

00:21:08.500 --> 00:21:10.790
Wh-what's wrong?

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.750
Natsuki-san?

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:13.580
Wh...

00:21:13.580 --> 00:21:14.410
Huh?

00:21:14.410 --> 00:21:15.700
It's nothing!

00:21:15.700 --> 00:21:18.250
Huh? But your face is red.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.910
When I say it's nothing, then I mean it's nothing!

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:24.910
Uh... N..Natsuki-san?

00:21:24.910 --> 00:21:27.620
Shut your mouth! And don't follow me!

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:30.200
What?! Was it something I did?!

00:21:30.200 --> 00:21:31.790
Natsuki-san!

00:21:32.040 --> 00:21:34.450
Please, wait up!

00:23:06.330 --> 00:23:09.200
The akuma are appearing in rapid succession,

00:23:09.200 --> 00:23:12.290
so perhaps there's something
going on at the school after all?

00:23:12.290 --> 00:23:13.790
I hope it'll be okay.

00:23:13.790 --> 00:23:16.290
The campus festival has finally just begun.

00:23:16.540 --> 00:23:22.200
If we succeed at the Val Love, "Festival Date"
then everyone can level up all at once.

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:23.410
We have to give it our best!

00:23:23.410 --> 00:23:27.080
You've become somewhat
reliable lately, Mutsumi-chan.

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:41.000
Next time: The 
Believing Maiden

00:23:27.410 --> 00:23:29.950
Next time: "The Believing Maiden."

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:33.330
Now that I think about it, your panties are

00:23:33.330 --> 00:23:35.790
the only ones I have yet to snatch, Mutsumi-chan.

00:23:35.790 --> 00:23:38.580
Big Sister Futaba, why are you wearing glasses?!

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:40.200
Wait!
